    "detailed_description": "<h1>Discord Channel</h1><p>Join Blackburne Games discord community<br>[/url]</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Ex Natura: Nature Corrupted is a souls-like game with Enrage mechanic which sets in a Nature themed dark fantasy world. Fight your way from the deepest dungeons to the top of the clouds and save the corrupted nature in this mysterious &quot;pre-human&quot; era-themed epic story.\n\n[imgvid poster.avif=\"\" mp4=\"\" webm=\"\"][/imgvid]\n\n[b][h2]You will play as Elrih The God of Air. Walk within the footsteps with him to experience the journey he goes through to claim his throne.\n[/h2][/b]\n[h2][b]LORE [/b][/h2]\n\nLong time ago, on a planet made of dust, with no plants or trees, lived Primogenitus (first people). Then came the clouds and the rain, lakes and seas came into existence; saplings of The World Tree started to grow inside The Heart Of The Earth. \nG\u00fbl wanted to decimate the World tree while Elrih wanted it to preseve it. Therefore, a war broke out between G\u00fbl and Elrih. \nAs a consequence of this age-old war, the Primogenitus fell out of power and evolved into today\u2019s humans. G\u00fbl became the one who was defeated and captivated under The World Tree. \nAfter thousands of years, a malignant cult of humans goes to The World Tree, breaks the seal that holds G\u00fbl captive and G\u00fbl becomes free. \n\n[h2][b]COMBAT[/b][/h2]\n[i][b]Powerful Foes &amp; Epic Boss Scenes[/b][/i]\nDefeat the ones who obey the corrupted world of Ex Natura. Clear them all by using your power of straight and magic.\n\n[h2][b]SKILLTREE [/b][/h2]\n[i][b]Choose your own path[/b][/i]\nEvolve with powerful new skills and abilities and defeat your enemies  in a way that adapts to your style of play.\n\n[h2][b]GATHER &amp; CRAFT[/b][/h2]\n[i][b]You have to be prepared for battle[/b][/i]\nSummon your magic and stir the right herbs into a powerful potion.\n\n[h2][b]EXPLORE &amp; SOLVE PUZZLES[/b][/h2]\n[i][b]Cruel World of Ex Natura is waiting for you to discover[/b][/i]\nUse your wisdom to solve puzzles and explore the world with your curiosity.\n\n[b][h2]Highlights / Features[/h2][/b]\n[list][*]More than 16+ defeatable foes\n[*]Progressive difficulty and character progression system\n[*]A variety of biomes for players to explore\n[*]Epic bosses with their unique fighting\n[*]Numerous Unlockable skins\n[*]Mysterious puzzles, engaging platforming elements, and a fast responsive combat system.\n[*]Rich Story[/list]\n\n[img][/img</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Ex Natura: Nature Corrupted is a souls-like game with Enrage mechanic which sets in a Nature themed dark fantasy world. Fight your way from the deepest dungeons to the top of the clouds and save the corrupted nature in this mysterious &quot;pre-human&quot; era-themed epic story.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1557180/extras/96d93510057785e85f7cf074bc78c36e.poster.avif?t=1702588074\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1557180/extras/96d93510057785e85f7cf074bc78c36e.webm?t=1702588074\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1557180/extras/96d93510057785e85f7cf074bc78c36e.mp4?t=1702588074\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">You will play as Elrih The God of Air. Walk within the footsteps with him to experience the journey he goes through to claim his throne.</h2></strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>LORE </strong></h2><br>Long time ago, on a planet made of dust, with no plants or trees, lived Primogenitus (first people). Then came the clouds and the rain, lakes and seas came into existence; saplings of The World Tree started to grow inside The Heart Of The Earth. <br>G\u00fbl wanted to decimate the World tree while Elrih wanted it to preseve it. Therefore, a war broke out between G\u00fbl and Elrih. <br>As a consequence of this age-old war, the Primogenitus fell out of power and evolved into today\u2019s humans. G\u00fbl became the one who was defeated and captivated under The World Tree. <br>After thousands of years, a malignant cult of humans goes to The World Tree, breaks the seal that holds G\u00fbl captive and G\u00fbl becomes free.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>COMBAT</strong></h2><i><strong>Powerful Foes &amp; Epic Boss Scenes</strong></i><br>Defeat the ones who obey the corrupted world of Ex Natura. Clear them all by using your power of straight and magic.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>SKILLTREE </strong></h2><i><strong>Choose your own path</strong></i><br>Evolve with powerful new skills and abilities and defeat your enemies  in a way that adapts to your style of play.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>GATHER &amp; CRAFT</strong></h2><i><strong>You have to be prepared for battle</strong></i><br>Summon your magic and stir the right herbs into a powerful potion.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>EXPLORE &amp; SOLVE PUZZLES</strong></h2><i><strong>Cruel World of Ex Natura is waiting for you to discover</strong></i><br>Use your wisdom to solve puzzles and explore the world with your curiosity.<br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Highlights / Features</h2></strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>More than 16+ defeatable foes<br></li><li>Progressive difficulty and character progression system<br></li><li>A variety of biomes for players to explore<br></li><li>Epic bosses with their unique fighting<br></li><li>Numerous Unlockable skins<br></li><li>Mysterious puzzles, engaging platforming elements, and a fast responsive combat system.<br></li><li>Rich Story</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1557180/extras/162526a8152e99d5fa9697a0e4a9382c.avif?t=1702588074\" /></div>",
